{"3481630": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "CLIMB IT!", "steam_appid": 3481630, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Embark on a path to greatness in a relentless vertical adventure!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Climb a colossal mountain, overcoming daunting cliffs, perilous ledges, and unexpected obstacles. Test your skills and agility on a challenging route using diverse movement mechanics. Can you complete the ascent?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3481630/extras/7f2bb17aa80a4fa0181f31c9eb696242.poster.avif?t=1786959672\" width=1170 height=434 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3481630/extras/7f2bb17aa80a4fa0181f31c9eb696242.webm?t=1786959672\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3481630/extras/7f2bb17aa80a4fa0181f31c9eb696242.mp4?t=1786959672\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will get:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The joy of success and the pain of mistakes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Diverse movement mechanics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rewards for active gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple climbing routes</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hidden passages</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >During the climb, you’ll face dangers and have to make tough decisions. Be careful—small mistakes can lead to big falls.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3481630/extras/59ee4643489db65af585909aa6502daf.poster.avif?t=1786959672\" width=1170 height=434 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3481630/extras/59ee4643489db65af585909aa6502daf.webm?t=1786959672\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3481630/extras/59ee4643489db65af585909aa6502daf.mp4?t=1786959672\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Feel the rush of adrenaline as you move swiftly across the rocks, building up your reserves for critical moments. Activate it to slow down time, enabling more precise jumps and increasing your chances of overcoming the toughest challenges. Will you harness this power to reach the peak?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3481630/extras/73f5f6f1bf2052b744a964cca76107e3.poster.avif?t=1786959672\" width=1170 height=434 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3481630/extras/73f5f6f1bf2052b744a964cca76107e3.webm?t=1786959672\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3481630/extras/73f5f6f1bf2052b744a964cca76107e3.mp4?t=1786959672\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Embark on a path to greatness in a relentless vertical adventure!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Climb a colossal mountain, overcoming daunting cliffs, perilous ledges, and unexpected obstacles. Test your skills and agility on a challenging route using diverse movement mechanics. Can you complete the ascent?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3481630/extras